# HCM Lite — environment variables.
# Copy to .env.local for local development, or set these in your Vercel
# project settings. Never commit real keys (`.env*` is git-ignored).

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Supabase (REQUIRED — the single source of truth)
# Project Settings → API in the Supabase dashboard.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Public values (safe to expose to the browser; protected by Row Level Security):
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=

# SERVER-ONLY. Bypasses RLS. Used exclusively inside server code for:
# audit_log inserts (the table accepts no client writes at all) and
# auth.admin user management. Never prefix with NEXT_PUBLIC_, never log it.
SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Google Gemini (optional — real AI answers)
# Without a key the assistant runs the grounded mock: a deterministic planner
# answering from the same tools and permission layer. No fallback key exists
# in the source; rotate any key that ever appeared in a repository.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
GEMINI_API_KEY=
AI_API_KEY=
